### 创建产品
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products
Authorization: Basic victor 123456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "indicatorDigit": "0",
  "companyPrefix":"697951098",
  "itemReference": "001",
  "lotNumber": "ABC123",
  "name": "一次性丁腈手套",
  "specification": "规格",
  "model": "型号",
  "productionDate": "2026-10-01",
  "expirationDate": "2031-09-30"
}

### 查询产品列表
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products

### 查询产品
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products/01a1585c-2780-7e76-929a-14edcc0cebc2

### 修改产品
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products/01a1585c-2780-7e76-929a-14edcc0cebc2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "indicatorDigit": "0",
  "companyPrefix":"697951098",
  "itemReference": "002",
  "lotNumber": "ABC1234",
  "name": "一次性丁腈手套2",
  "specification": "规格2",
  "model": "型号2",
  "productionDate": "2026-10-02",
  "expirationDate": "2031-09-20"
}

### 停用产品
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products/01a1585c-2780-7e76-929a-14edcc0cebc2